# List files or directories below to ignore them when running force:source:push, force:source:pull, and force:source:status
# More information: https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.sfdx_dev.meta/sfdx_dev/sfdx_dev_exclude_source.htm
#

package.xml

# Profiles are never deployed. A Profile cannot provision a required field; the
# deploy fails and rollbackOnError then rolls back EVERY custom object with it
# (AGENTS.md control test E3). Real guard: scripts/preflight-deploy.mjs, which runs
# before every repository-owned deploy path. These patterns are a second layer.
**/profiles/**
**/*.profile-meta.xml
**/sharingRules/**
**/*.sharingRules-meta.xml
**/sharingSets/**
**/*.sharingSet-meta.xml

# LWC configuration files
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json

# LWC Jest
**/__tests__/**

# Experience Cloud belongs to the `frontend` project (AGENTS.md metadata
# ownership). A retrieve without an explicit member list pulls the stock
# Communities template set into this project: a second Network/Site, ~46 VF
# pages and the self-registration controllers that Phase 0 / ADR-005
# deliberately removed. Because both projects deploy with a bare
# `sf project deploy start`, that residue goes live on the next backend
# deploy and contradicts `selfRegistration=false`.
**/networks/**
**/sites/**
**/digitalExperienceConfigs/**
**/digitalExperiences/**
**/networkBranding/**
**/experiences/**
**/audience/**
**/experienceBundle/**
**/pages/**
**/aura/**
**/components/**
**/customindex/**
**/navigationMenus/**
**/appMenus/**
**/siteProfile/**
**/sharingSites/**
**/managedContent/****

# Foreign managed-package metadata (Partner Marketing `prm_*`, MDF). Owned by
# the package, not by this project; deploying it makes us responsible for it.
**/reportTypes/prm_*
**/reportTypes/MDF_*
**/reports/prm_*
**/dashboards/prm_*
**/dashboards/cmc_*
**/staticresources/SiteSamples*
**/objects/prm_*

node_modules/
